ime","idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"acos action"},"description":"NOT THE CANONICAL TOOL — prefer the one-purpose session tools on a live ART session: `acos_tap` (id/text/testID or a point), `acos_text` (focused editor), `acos_key` and `acos_swipe`. They report the action's own ack and settle evidence. This tool keeps the generic multi-action path (tap, long_press, swipe, type, key, back, rotate, wait) and is kept for compatibility. Deliver one input action. Prefer selectors over coordinates. Returns accepted/state_changed, an input-ack event seq and optionally a fresh frame. Common errors: ELEMENT_NOT_FOUND, SESSION_NOT_FOUND, TIMEOUT, APP_NOT_RESPONDING, NO_DISPLAY.\n\n[MCP: available=true fidelity=native-runtime command=action]","inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","definitions":{"Action":{"description":"One input action.","oneOf":[{"description":"Tap a selector or a point.","properties":{"kind":{"enum":["tap"],"type":"string"},"selector":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/definitions/Selector"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Target selector (mutually exclusive with x/y)."},"timeout_ms":{"description":"Event-driven timeout.","format":"uint64","minimum":0.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"x":{"description":"Explicit x (mutually exclusive with selector).","format":"int32","type":["integer","null"]},"y":{"description":"Explicit y (mutually exclusive with selector).","format":"int32","type":["integer","null"]}},"required":["kind"],"type":"object"},{"description":"Long-press a selector or point.","properties":{"duration_ms":{"default":600,"description":"Hold duration.","format":"uint64","minimum":0.0,"type":"integer"},"kind":{"enum":["long_press"],"type":"string"},"selector":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/definitions/Selector"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Target selector."},"x":{"description":"Explicit x.","format":"int32","type":["integer","null"]},"y":{"description":"Explicit y.","format":"int32","type":["integer","n